ottagono. La strada verso la redenzione prende però una svolta personale quando alla sua porta si presenta Manny (Danny Boyd, Jr.), il figlio che aveva abbandonato da neonato. BRUISED - LOTTARE PER VIVERE segna il debutto alla regia dell'attrice premio Oscar Halle Berry, affiancata da Adriane Lenox, Sheila Atim, Valentina Schevchenko e Stephen McKinley Henderson nella trionfante storia di una lottatrice che si riprende il potere dentro e fuori dal ring, dopo che tutti l'avevano considerata fuori dai giochi."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Jackie Justice is a mixed martial arts fighter who leaves the sport in disgrace. Down on her luck and simmering with rage and regret years after the fight, she's coaxed into a brutal underground fight by her manager and boyfriend Desi and grabs the attention of a fight league promoter who promises Jackie a life back in the Octagon. But the road to redemption becomes unexpectedly personal when Manny - the son she gave up as an infant - shows up at her doorstep. A triumphant story of a fighter who reclaims her power, in and out of the ring, when everyone has counted her out","tagline":"It's not a second chance. It's a last chance."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/XAYrZi9Z9zIcJCP9NqhT1eHmyR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iwyKRyOFlOZ1fBdONscHiDEcEgz.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":718633,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/XAYrZi9Z9zIcJCP9NqhT1eHmyR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/XAYrZi9Z9zIcJCP9NqhT1eHmyR.jpg","language":"it","width":1060,"height":1590},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/XAYrZi9Z9zIcJCP9NqhT1eHmyR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/XAYrZi9Z9zIcJCP9NqhT1eHmyR.jpg","lang